      "LEWIS: \"...twelve-hundred kilometers in diameter, bearing 24.41 degrees...\"\nJOHANSSEN: That's tracking right towards us.\nLEWIS: \"...based on current escalation, estimate a force of... \"Eighty-six hundred Newtons.\"",
